<title>USA: NYSEG filing deadline extended 1 week.</title>
<headline>NYSEG filing deadline extended 1 week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Public Service Commission has extended restructuring talks with New York State Electric and Gas Corp to March 7, spokesman Dave Flanagan said Thursday.</p>
<p>He offered no explanation as to why NYSEG's deadline was set three days ahead of the March 10 deadline imposed on the other four utilities participating in the talks.</p>
<p>((-- Jim Brumm 212-859-1710.))</p>
